1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,773
The host names trip students up every year.

2
00:00:02,773 --> 00:00:08,072
The definitive host is where sexual reproduction happens: the mosquito.

3
00:00:08,072 --> 00:00:13,671
We are only the intermediate host, where the parasite multiplies asexually.

4
00:00:13,671 --> 00:00:19,895
Nepal has nearly eliminated malaria: just thirty seven local cases in twenty twenty four.

